{%- comment -%}
  ==========================================================================
  Murphy & Form — preorder date
  --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  The single source of truth for whether something is on preorder.
  Outputs a lead time, or nothing at all.

  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  TO PUT THE WHOLE SHOP ON PREORDER                                     │
  │  Put a lead time between the quotes on the line below.                 │
  │  Write it the way you'd say it out loud:                              │
  │                                                                        │
  │      assign mf_shop_preorder = '20 business days'                      │
  │                                                                        │
  │  TO TURN IT OFF                                                        │
  │  Make it empty again:                                                  │
  │                                                                        │
  │      assign mf_shop_preorder = ''                                      │
  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  TO PUT ONE PRODUCT ON PREORDER, leave the line above empty and tag that
  product in Shopify:

      preorder:12 business days

  A product's own tag always wins over the shop-wide setting, so you can put
  the whole shop at twenty days and still promise twelve on one item that's
  already half built.

  Nothing here charges differently or changes inventory. It changes what the
  customer is told, which is the part that matters.
  ==========================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign mf_shop_preorder = '20 business days'

  assign mf_result = mf_shop_preorder

  if product != blank
    for mf_tag in product.tags
      assign mf_lower = mf_tag | downcase
      if mf_lower contains 'preorder:'
        assign mf_result = mf_tag | split: ':' | last | strip
      endif
    endfor
  endif
-%}
{{- mf_result -}}
